{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1784799711","published":"2026-07-23T09:42:17Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:47.203976046Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-59858"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-59858","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: arbitrary Ex command execution during C omni-completion:\n     the C omni-completion script interpolated the typeref/typename tag field\n     of a tags entry, without escaping, into a :vimgrep pattern run through\n     :execute. Because :vimgrep honours the bar as a command separator, a\n     crafted tag field could close the search pattern and append an arbitrary\n     Ex command, which ran when C omni-completion was invoked on a hostile .c\n     file whose project tags file carried such an entry.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-59858.patch: escape the type field with\n       escape(typename, '/\\') before building the :vimgrep pattern in\n       s:StructMembers(), in runtime/autoload/ccomplete.vim; matches upstream\n       patch 9.2.0735.\n     - CVE-2026-59858","affected":[{"package":{"name":"vim","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/vim?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:7.4.1689-3ubuntu1.5+tuxcare.els71"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu16.04els/CLSA-2026-1784799711.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vim-athena","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/vim-athena?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:7.4.1689-3ubuntu1.5+tuxcare.els71"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu16.04els/CLSA-2026-1784799711.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vim-athena-py2","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/vim-athena-py2?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:7.4.1689-3ubuntu1.5+tuxcare.els71"}]}],"dat